DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
31861::$$$message_0248_0000_0000$$$::There's no one at the mountain gate.[lr]::
31862::$$$message_0248_0000_0001$$$::Just shy of an hour's walk from town, the mountain is shrouded in silence, and nothing seems particularly amiss here.::
31863::$$$message_0248_0001_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
31864::$$$message_0248_0001_0001$$$::Saber's been to Ryudou Temple before, but this is her first time back since the Holy Grail War.[lr]::
31865::$$$message_0248_0001_0002$$$::That's odd. I'd be fine if I were on my own, but I feel a little awkward with Saber here.[lr]::
31866::$$$message_0248_0001_0003$$$::Something must be slumbering here...[lr]::
31867::$$$message_0248_0001_0004$$$::...something that won't last much longer.::
31868::$$$message_0248_0002_0000$$$::"Shirou?"[lr]::
31869::$$$message_0248_0002_0001$$$::"Sorry, I got lost in thought. Do you sense anything, Saber?"[lr]::
31870::$$$message_0248_0002_0002$$$::"Nothing seems amiss. Even if there was some new abnormality, I doubt this place would be attacked first."::
31871::$$$message_0248_0003_0000$$$::"This is Caster's stronghold, after all. Its defenses are comprehensive.[lr]::
31872::$$$message_0248_0003_0001$$$::She would still be cautious against other Servants, even after the war is over."::
31873::$$$message_0248_0004_0000$$$::"Yeah. I visit the temple sometimes, but I always get the sense I'm surrounded when I do. Mr. Kuzuki asked me to be patient with her because she isn't used to interacting with strangers, [cacheimage storage=セイバー鎧04e(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバー鎧04e(中)]though..."[lr]::
31874::$$$message_0248_0004_0001$$$::I suppose I can hardly expect her to have a sudden friendly change of heart, after all the shady stuff she pulled during the Holy Grail War.::
31875::$$$message_0248_0005_0000$$$::"Saber, what do you think? Does Caster seem like she's involved this time?"[lr]::
31876::$$$message_0248_0005_0001$$$::"I don't mean to come to her defense, but this probably is not her doing. Even if the Holy Grail War were to resume, she doesn't have a wish she wants granted."[lr]::
31877::$$$message_0248_0005_0002$$$::"...Yeah. Caster might want this situation to continue even more than we do. [wvl][seloop volume=25 time=100 storage=se407.wav]This is a peaceful life she's never been able to enjoy before."::
31878::$$$message_0248_0006_0000$$$::...[sestop time=100 nowait=true]Well, that aside...[lr]::
31879::$$$message_0248_0006_0001$$$::"When you mentioned the defenses, did you mean there are measures other than Assassin?"[lr]::
31880::$$$message_0248_0006_0002$$$::"Yes, a concerning amount of defensive Bounded Fields. Assassin may have been initially summoned to guard the gate, but over the last month, Ryudou Temple's defenses have dramatically increased, even though we're at peace.[lr]::
31881::$$$message_0248_0006_0003$$$::It's enough to make one suspect that Caster is simply experimenting with Bounded Fields out of some bizarre fascination, rather than for protection."::
31882::$$$message_0248_0007_0000$$$::Huh.[lr]::
31883::$$$message_0248_0007_0001$$$::Saber's pretty harsh on Caster sometimes.[lr]::
31884::$$$message_0248_0007_0002$$$::Even if we were to become friends with Caster through some twist of fate, it's clear that there's tension between them simmering beneath the surface.::
31885::$$$message_0248_0008_0000$$$::"Still though, we don't need to go all the way inside. Nothing seems wrong for now, and poking the bear might only make things worse."[lr]::
31886::$$$message_0248_0008_0001$$$::I'd rather not be mistaken for an enemy attacker.[lr]::
31887::$$$message_0248_0008_0002$$$::If it turns into a Servant battle over a simple mistake, the other Servants might not sit still, either.::
31888::$$$message_0248_0009_0000$$$::"Yes. Let us leave this to Assassin and return to town. He is somewhat difficult to deal with, but not the sort of man to take underhanded measures.[lr]::
31889::$$$message_0248_0009_0001$$$::He will attempt to murder you for the thrill of a duel to the death, but he enjoys tranquility just as much."::
31890::$$$message_0248_0010_0000$$$::Saber's right. No unsavory characters will get through under Assassin's watch.::
931861::$$$message_9248_0000_0000$$$::There's no one at the mountain gate.::f�